# Pinned sources — the guest image is reproducible from these (doc 07 §2, §7.1).
# sha256 discipline: `make fetch` verifies; `make fetch record=1` records a new
# pin (review the download source before committing the recorded value).
# Kernel: current longterm line (kernel.org, checked 2026-10-19); floor is >= 6.6
# (io_uring_disabled availability on the HOST side — E-5; the guest kernel just
# needs virtio + v6 + serial console).
KERNEL_VERSION := 6.18.57
KERNEL_SHA256 := 5bd9acdc82ec5efc3790ae840e5aaa40dfde7efff261cf6dde902dc570acf98c

# BusyBox: static, the whole userland of the guest rootfs.
BUSYBOX_VERSION := 1.36.1
BUSYBOX_SHA256 := b8cc24c9574d809e7279c3be349795c5d5ceb6fdf19ca709f80cde50e47de314
